===Etymology===
* As an {{der|en|ga|-}} surname, from {{m|ga|Ó}} {{m|ga|Móráin|t=descendant of Mórán}}, from {{m|ga|mór|t=large, great}}.
* Also as an Irish surname, from  {{m|ga|Ó}} {{m|ga|Moghráin}}, {{m|ga|Mughróin|t=descendant of Mughrón}}, personal name from {{m|ga|mogh|t=slave}} + {{m|ga|rón|t=seal}}. Sometimes also shortened from {{m|en|McMorran}}.
* As an English surname, variant of {{m|en|Morrin}}.
* As a {{der|en|es|-}} surname, variant of {{m|en|Morán}}.
* As a {{der|en|fr|-}} surname, variant of {{m|en|Morin}}.
* Variant of the English and {{der|en|fr|-}} surname {{m|en|Morant}}.

